{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MiaBSXuJ9Q7Vg3vmf1eLHj","type":"tool_result","content":"# household\n\nSmall helpers for sharing a household's bills.\n\n- `split_bill(total_cents, people)` splits a bill into whole cents. The shares always add up to exactly\n  `total_cents`; the cents left over go one each to the first people in the list, so a share never differs from\n  another by more than one cent.\n- `due_dates(first, count)` lists the dates of `count` monthly payments, starting on `first` and falling on the\n  same day of each following month (the last day of a shorter month when that day does not exist).\n\nRun the tests with `python3 -m unittest -q`.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"711d6a97-f0ad-4269-8c24-0fac76796493","uuid":"ab981364-7ffb-4dce-bb39-17cdaa63c838","timestamp":"2026-11-22T22:39:03.433Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"# household\n\nSmall helpers for sharing a household's bills.\n\n- `split_bill(total_cents, people)` splits a bill into whole cents. The shares always add up to exactly\n  `total_cents`; the cents left over go one each to the first people in the list, so a share never differs from\n  another by more than one cent.\n- `due_dates(first, count)` lists the dates of `count` monthly payments, starting on `first` and falling on the\n  same day of each following month (the last day of a shorter month when that day does not exist).\n\nRun the tests with `python3 -m unittest -q`.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01MiaBSXuJ9Q7Vg3vmf1eLHj","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
